window.products.push({"id":872106,"name":"EASTARTIST Duvet Insert Twin Comforter - Lightweight Down Comforter Quilted Hotel Bedding Comforters, Ultra Soft All Season Down Alternative Comforter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71N5hkw2MZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SOFT FLUFFY & COMFORTABLE: Made of Ultra Soft & Breathable Brushed Microfiber Fabric, our quilted down alternative comforter feels very soft & fluffy, thickness for all seasons. Great safe & healthy for those with sensitive skin or allergic to goose down comforter or featherbedding. Zero noise for soundly sleeping. You can use it as a duvet insert, stand-alone comforter, or blanket. A great choice for your living room. LIGHTWEIGHT & BREATHABLE: Our Duvet Comforter Fillings are made of 3D 300 GSM, a premium WHOLE-PIECE polyfill fabric,with exquisite Hemming and Box Stitching Tech, the fillings will stay in place, and not easily gone.Microfiber has nice thermal ability which will keep you warm in cold winter. Proper weight, you will feel no pressure upon your body. EASY TO STALL&CHANGE: Box Stitching Scientific Design add great comfort and elegance, and will keep the fillings not shift or clump. ZERO concern of leakage or ripping. There are 8 side and corner loops/tabs for you to secure your comforter cover in place.You can use it as a alone comforter or duvet insert. EASY CARE & GREAT VALUE. The white comforter twin can be machine washable and dryable, very easy to care and save money. The white duvet insert twin with good workmanship, definitely worth every penny you spent. There are 3 sizes available, tiwn comforters 64x88 inch, queen comforter 90x90 inch, king comforter 106x92 inch. LIGHTWEIGHT FOR ALL-SEASON USE. The lightweight comforter twin can be used all the year-round. The all reason comforter twin is light enough for summer when the night cools off and heavy enough for winter without feeling tied down into the bed. The twin comforter lightweight is an ideal gift choice for your family and friends on Father's Day, Mother's Day, Birthday, Christmas, New Year, Housewarming, or Back to School.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71N5hkw2MZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EASTARTIST","source_asin":"B09P326FJ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-872106","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P326FJ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P326FJ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
