window.products.push({"id":872111,"name":"Baxton Studio Carson Modern and Contemporary Grey Fabric Upholstered and Walnut Brown Finished Wood 2-Piece Bar Stool Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":190.12,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718z2bar-vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Superb comfort meets contemporary design in the Carson bar stool. Made in Malaysia, the Carson is crafted from wood in a classic square frame. The bar stool is fitted with a foam-padded seat underneath a layer of soft fabric and features a unique cut-out design on its back. This piece requires assembly and is finished in a warm walnut brown that complements the lighter tones of the fabric. Sturdy silver metal is fitted on the front footrest, making the Carson bar stool well suited for both commercial and residential settings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718z2bar-vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baxton Studio","source_asin":"B0BS3PFX66","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-872111","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS3PFX66","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS3PFX66","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":872112,"name":"Stoneline-Xtreme Germany's Series 9.6\" (24cm) Standard Saute Pan, Non-Stick Non-Toxic Stone Coating Cookware - 2016 Top of The line Model, Better Tast","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Y065n64kL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"1 round saute pan, 24 cm / 9.6\" diameter, height: 6.0 cm/ 2.4\", optional glass lid from Stoneline can be purchase separately Benefit from the famous and unique Stoneline Xtreme coating and also from many comfortable possible applications of this line. It comes with an extra quick release click handle. The main advantages of the STONELINE Xtreme cookware at a glance: Absolute scratch-proof STONELINE Xtreme non-stick coating, Optimal frying result and crispy fried meat, Best taste, Food cook on it would absolute taste better and just like cooking on real stone. This pan is suitable for all cookers. 100% safe natural stone cooking: PFOA Free, Lead Free, non-toxic, releases maximum flavor & aroma of foods for gourmet results. Vitamin gentle cooking without fat and oil, Non-stick, no scorching, Easy to clean, Suitable for all cookers, even induction cookers, Extra strong, non-distorting base, Base thickness 4.5 mm This product is ovenproof up to 180 °C (356 °F) Material: die-cast aluminium with Stoneline Xtreme coating inside and powder coating outside. Tips for cleaning and maintenance: We recommend cleaning the cooking and bakeware with some water and a mild detergent before first use. Afterwards spread some drops of cooking oil with a cleaning tissue on the coating. For further use you can renounce the application of fat or oil! Thanks to the easy-clean-effect we recommend the cleaning by hand. Just wipe out the cookware with hot water, detergent and a soft sponge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Y065n64kL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stoneline-Xtreme","source_asin":"B01H4YWI9K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-872112","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01H4YWI9K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01H4YWI9K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":872113,"name":"Organic Soy Wax Candle in Red Glass Jar\"Bella's Kiss\" Aroma with Hearts Decorations on Top - Valentine's Day Gift for Her for Women Wife Mother","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mAEnEFCrL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for the perfect Valentine's Day gift? Look no further than this beautiful, scented soy wax candle. Made by hand with eco-friendly materials. This candle is a great choice for anyone who loves aromatherapy. Best of all, it's a limited edition. Get yours while supplies last! \"Bella's kiss\" Soy Wax Candle in Red Design Glass Jar 6 oz. Burning time up to 25 hours. Natural Soy Wax Candle! Handmade in the USA. This Soy Wax candle in the \"Bella's kiss\" aroma is a lush blend of violet, gardenia, and jasmine with fresh grapefruit, vanilla, and white woods. It is a luxurious way to light up your day or evening. It is making it perfect for a romantic night in or a relaxing bath time. Show your love and appreciation with this wonderful Soy candle. This would be an amazing Valentine's day gift or any special occasion, or just a nice gift for her, but it's also perfect for any other special occasion or just to show your love and appreciation. ECOLOGICALLY FRIENDLY SOY WAX CANDLE - This candle is made of organic soy wax, which is safe for the environment. It burns cleanly and doesn't produce any harmful toxins, so you can enjoy its amazing scent without worrying about your health. BEAUTIFUL DECORATIVE CANDLE - This candle comes in a red decorative design glass jar that makes it perfect for gift-giving. VEGAN - This candle is vegan-friendly! No animal products were used during the production of this product. HANDMADE IN USA - All of our soy candles are handcrafted in small batches in the United States, using local ingredients whenever possible. We source as many materials locally as we can to reduce environmental impact and support local businesses. We use only the highest quality soy wax and essential oils to create our all-natural aromatherapy candles. You will love how it makes your home smell! WARNING! Burn within sight. Keep away from flammable objects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mAEnEFCrL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Relaxcation","source_asin":"B0BSVHYK4V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-872113","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSVHYK4V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSVHYK4V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":872114,"name":"Boston International Ivory Aviary Birdcage Lanterns, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pWDtGncIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Antiqued metal birdcage lanterns make a lovely addition to your indoor or outdoor space. It was the love and appreciation of fine design, along with the opportunity to create and market well-made, yet affordable products that lead Jonathan Newman and Steven Faulkner to found Boston international (bi) in 1986. In the beginning, bi was a boutique line with beautiful hand-made paper products from smaller suppliers in Italy, Spain, Germany, and the UK. Through the years, the company developed and grew. In 1996, Boston international added ideal home range (IHR) to their product mix and very shortly after that, bi began its relationship with new York's metropolitan museum of art. Through the combination of these lines, BI's core group of suppliers, and BI's development of proprietary lines and accessories, bi has become a major force in the gift industry today. Currently, bi partners with suppliers and manufacturers from around the globe to bring their vision to the us market and employs more than 50 people in rustic Holliston, Massachusetts, some 25 miles west of Boston. Boston international's philosophy is the same now as it was back in 1986: combine the very best design with the highest quality materials and manufacturing, then add outstanding distribution and unmatched customer service. Currently over 19,000 customers in 11 countries are the beneficiaries of this philosophy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pWDtGncIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boston International","source_asin":"B00TTG4IBS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-872114","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00TTG4IBS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00TTG4IBS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
