window.products.push({"id":872347,"name":"Joseph Joseph 8-Inch Elevate Bread Knife with Integrated Knife Rest and Storage Sheath","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-zAfx5YOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Elevate 8-inch Serrated Bread knife has a non-stick silicone coated Japanese steel blade with an ergonomic handle. The knife has an innovative weighted handle with an integrated knife rest, ensuring when the knife is placed down, its blade is always raised off the work surface-improving hygiene and reducing mess. Serrated bread knives are able to cut soft bread without crushing or squishing slices. Each knife comes with its own protective storage sheath to keep knives from dulling in the drawer and to protect hands. Blade measures 8-inch. Hand wash and dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-zAfx5YOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joseph Joseph","source_asin":"B0090WZHS4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-872347","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0090WZHS4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0090WZHS4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
