window.products.push({"id":872526,"name":"PHILORN Ironing Board Cover and Pad, Resist Scorching and Staining, 15x54 Inch Thick Padding Ironing Board Covers, Elasti Edges, 2 Fasteners and 1 Pro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+EOUhTDEL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"EASY TO INSTALL: Thick and durable ironing board cover for boards 51-55 inches long and 15-17 inches wide, and perfect for 15-54 inch plates. The elastic wrapping helps make installation easier, and the fasteners fit better on the ironing board. PREMIUM COTTON MATERIAL: The ironing board cover and pad are made of three-layer fabric, which is safe, non-toxic and not easy to tear. The pure cotton material is stain-proof, the anti-scalding needle-punched cotton can well avoid burning, the environmentally friendly sponge is more durable, and it is equipped with interlayer mesh for safe ironing. PERFECT FIT: The edge of the ironing board cover is elastically designed to fit snugly and securely on the board, preventing slippage and making ironing faster and easier. The included two fasteners can be pulled closer to the surface of the cover, making the cover smooth and easy to iron, saving time. FASTER IRONING: The synthetic design of compact three-layer cotton can evenly diffuse heat and steam, which can reflect heat faster and better, and easily solve the problems caused by uneven heating. At the same time, the design that closely fits the board can not only improve the ironing safety, but also shorten the ironing time, so that you can enjoy ironing happily. USAGE NOTES: The ironing board cover is made of thick needle-punched cotton, the perfect thickness to withstand high temperature ironing up to 200°C. The three-layer compact design will not easily discolor and resist scorch when ironing. The ironing board cover is made of 100% cotton. Do not machine wash or soak in water, wash dry only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+EOUhTDEL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PHILORN","source_asin":"B0BL6WTQVY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-872526","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL6WTQVY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL6WTQVY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
