window.products.push({"id":872751,"name":"Coffee Cup Warmer for Desk Auto Shut Off- Plus Aluminum Heater Disc for Concave Bottom Mugs- Enhance Coffee Temperature for Home Office Stylish Heater","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FaD8chKWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There’s nothing like a fresh cup of hot coffee in the morning or afternoon. Why not invest in a mug warmer to keep your preferred beverage from getting cold in the first place? With the use of a selavif cup warmer, it doesn’t have to be this way– If you are tired to try many mug warmers or find flat-bottomed mugs, it is right place! With Selavif Smart Aluminum Disc, each sip is full of delicious warmth! You can enjoy your coffee at a constant desired temperature for hours – the entire time that it’s in the cup. Our coffee mug warmer have some fun, interesting, and helpful features so we’re sure it suits your needs and style .Waterproof Glass Heating Surface We select the glass as the heating surface of our beverage warmer. In addition to easy cleaning, it brings Selavif mug warmer with the waterproof function.Features touch-tech controls, a vivid and easy-to-read LED display, you can clearly see what temperature level you selected and and set the powering-off time freely between 1-12 hours With the one-touch control design, you can easily switch the temperature level between 104℉(40℃) and 140℉(60℃).The left button is timing function. Selavif Mug Warmer has an automatic shut-off, that automatically turns the machine off after 8 hours. Even if careless to turn it off, no potential fire hazards out of control.Heat dissipation performance of our mug coaster is impressive and even after long-time heating, the heating glass surface will cool down in short time to ensure safety.Four rubber anti-slip pads make your mug stable on the desk.Noise Free & Visible Hot Surface SignThe 18-watt mug warmer measures 4.53 x 4.53 inches, while the hot plate is 3.15 inches wide. Selavif R&D center suggests using mugs with flat bottoms for better resultsThe cord is about 60 inches long adds for increased mobility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FaD8chKWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Selavif","source_asin":"B098XB5WNV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-872751","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098XB5WNV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098XB5WNV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
