window.products.push({"id":872912,"name":"Air Purifier for Home Bedroom Large Room, 20dB Very Quiet Filtration System Cleaner Odor Eliminator, Remove Dust Smoke Pollen Dander Hair Smell, with ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RhqAVB1NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WIDE COVERAGE AIR PURIFIER FOR LARGE ROOM - With the high-efficiency filtration system, MOOKA EPI153 air purifier cleans a 1200ft²(112m²) room in 60 minutes, cleans a 430ft²(40m²) room in 25 minutes, cleans a 215ft²(20m²) room in 7 minutes. Modern design fits in any space from small to large rooms, bedrooms, living rooms, offices, baby rooms, kitchens and basements. Perfect for pet owners, allergics, babies, children, the elderly, or anyone wanting to improve the air quality. HIGH CADR H13 TRUE HEPA AIR PURIFIER – The pre-filter, H13 true HEPA filter and high-efficiency activated carbon filter capture allergens, pet hair, dander, smoke, odor, and large dust particles, in addition to removing airborne contaminants as small as 0.3 microns. Powerful efficient Air filter cleaner prevents respiratory problems, allergic reactions, and asthma. QUIET, ENERGY-SAVING WITH SMART FILTER REMINDER - Let your purifier work unnoticed thanks to the extremely quiet but powerful motor. It makes air cleaner lightweight and quiet, not affect your work, study or sleep. Running in low power makes it a winner for energy-saving. The filter change reminder notifies you when it's time for a fresh filter. The replacement filter should be replaced every 3-6 months depending on the environment and usage frequency (Search for B09N37Z2X5). CLEAR DISPLAY PANEL WITH NIGHT LIGHT – The buttons on the panel include: power button, timer button, speed button and filter change reminder button. The 4 timer options (1H/2H/4H/8H) allow you set the air purifier to run for a specific time, helping you save energy and money, while 4 modes (Sleep/1/2/3) allow you to choose a speed based on different purification needs and size of the room. Press any button on the body for 3 seconds to turn ON/OFF the night light when the machine is running. WORRY-FREE PURCHASE - We love our customers and take pride in providing a pleasant shopping experience. If you have any questions, please get in touch with us. We offer 24/7 live chat or call support and try our best to solve the problems for you. Tips: please remove the plastic bag off the H13 HEPA filter before running the air purifier.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RhqAVB1NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOOKA","source_asin":"B09N3758GB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-872912","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N3758GB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N3758GB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
