window.products.push({"id":872951,"name":"Vacuum Sealer Food Vacuum Packing Machine with Vacuum Hose Automatic Vacuum Sealing System Plus 10pcs FREE Sealer Bags for Kitchen Dry & Moist Food Pr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WB04aPoqL._AC_.jpg","description":"vacuum sealer Automatic Vacuum Sealer Keep Your Food Fresh and Enjoy Your Perfect Taste Freshness and Nutrition Keep the nutrients intact and food fresh 5 x longer than ordinary storage methods, eliminates freezer burn, reduces spoilage and food waste Easy Operation  Press the function button you need without choosing the types of the food.  It would takes 5-7 second to vacuums out air and create a strong heat seal, automatically stopping once food is airtight and ready for storage.You can also press the button to stop the device from working to further control the vacuum pressure. Compact Design  Our Compact Vacuum Sealer Machine is easy to store in a full kitchen and portable size allows you to take it around.    How to Use:  ①Put the food into the food sealer bags.  ②Put down the cover and lock the two side.  ③Press the button start to work, it’s down while light turn to green.  ④Poll up the release valva, open it and put out the bag.   Cleaning and Maintenance:  1. Always unplug the unit before cleaning the appliance. 2. Do not immerse it in water or any other liquid. 3. Do not use abrasive cleaners to clean the unit, as they will scratch the surface.  4. Wipe the outside of the unit with a damp cloth or sponge and mild detergent. 5. To clean the inside of the unit, wipe away any food or liquid with a paper towel. 6. Dry thoroughly before using it again. Packaged Included:  1 x Vacuum Sealer  10 x Vacuum Bags  1 x User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WB04aPoqL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bobozheng","source_asin":"B07GDNCHW4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-872951","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GDNCHW4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GDNCHW4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
